BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coastal Cruisers - The Golden Hour
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260502
DTSTAMP:20260904T143208Z
UID:9f3864060ce7679e35293700f37c@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Island in our Coastal Cruisers\, Newport’s pr
 ivate chauffeured luxury tour\, dedicated to providing a sophisticated way
  to experience our beloved island. We blend elegance\, fun &amp\; storytel
 ling into a bespoke tour of Newport. For us\, it is about fostering experi
 ences that create lasting memorable moments. From chasing golden sunsets t
 o experiencing salty-breeze adventures\, Coastal Cruisers treats every tou
 r as an opportunity to provide exceptional service &amp\; a personal conne
 ction that lasts well beyond the journey. Offer 3 tour options and hourly 
 bookings. Tour Option: The Golden Hour A private\, bespoke guided excursio
 n designed to highlight Newport's most magnificent sunset vistas. This dis
 tinctive experience is meticulously orchestrated\, ensuring optimal positi
 oning at prime viewing locations for capturing striking photographs &amp\;
  securing a truly memorable occasion. Your experienced guide will navigate
  picturesque coastal thoroughfares and Newport's charming bridge view neig
 hborhoods\, making stops at both lesser-known vantage points &amp\; renown
 ed landmarks celebrated for their exceptional 'golden hour' illumination &
 amp\; sweeping ocean panoramas. 7:00 PM Tour (75 minutes) $150 per person 
 Available: Daily\, May 1 - December 31\, 2026 (Unavailable May 23 and May 
 31)\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/coastal-cruisers-the
 -golden-hour/109827/
LOCATION:Coastal Cruisers\, 478 Thames Street\, Newport\, RI 02840
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/coastal-cruisers-the-golden-hou
 r/109827/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dueling Pianos at the Top of Pelham
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260501
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260502
DTSTAMP:20260904T143208Z
UID:60db075f3503c7ed2d6aa2d4f46a@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Dueling Pianos at the Top of Pelham Please check your dates an
 d times — show start times vary. For more dates and showtimes\, check ou
 t Eventbrite. Located directly above One Pelham East\, the Top Of Pelham i
 s proud to be the only venue in Newport\, Rhode Island\, hosting a live Du
 eling Pianos Show! Situated across from Bowen’s Wharf on historic Thames
  Street\, The Top delivers exceptional live entertainment featuring nation
 ally known performers\, with a stunning view of the world-famous Newport H
 arbor. Every weekend\, our stage is filled with two grand pianos as entert
 ainers perform audience requests from every genre and era imaginable. Thro
 ughout the show\, audience members are invited on stage for toasts and spe
 cial dedication songs\, creating an unforgettable evening. This live music
  experience is ideal for a night out in town\, bachelorette parties\, birt
 hday celebrations\, and corporate events. No matter the occasion\, a great
  time is guaranteed! Please note\, all events are strictly for individuals
  aged 21 and over. Disclaimer: Due to rare last-minute scheduling conflict
 s\, piano players are subject to change.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhode
 island.com/event/dueling-pianos-at-the-top-of-pelham/109832/
LOCATION:Dueling Pianos at the Top of Pelham\, 3 Pelham Street\, Newport\,
  RI 02840
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/dueling-pianos-at-the-top-of-pe
 lham/109832/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beyond the Brewhouse Tour
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260516
DTSTAMP:20260904T143208Z
UID:acc9d8e1d1bdab34c6766b602473@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Beyond the Brewhouse Where: Newport Craft Brewing and Distilli
 ng\, 293 JT Connell Road\, Newport 45 minutes: $20 per person Did you know
  that we are a Distillery too? Going beyond the brewhouse\, our expert tou
 r guide will provide you with an in-depth explanation of our brewing and d
 istilling processes. Tour the brewhouse\, take a peek at our Sour room\, a
 nd walk through our distillery. Conclude the tour with a brew and spirit f
 light for a complete palate experience. Ages 21+\n\nSource: https://www.vi
 sitrhodeisland.com/event/beyond-the-brewhouse-tour/110153/
LOCATION:Newport Craft Brewing & Distilling Company\, 293 JT Connell Road
 \, Newport\, RI 02840 Time: 45 minutes: Tour start time varies by booking.
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/beyond-the-brewhouse-tour/11015
 3/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ca' del Bosco Wine Garden
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260522
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260523
DTSTAMP:20260904T143208Z
UID:ec504bb30a685e605b7475ceee57@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Ca' del Bosco Wine Garden Location: The Chanler at Cliff Walk 
 May 22 - September 7\, 2026 1:00 PM - 8:00 PM This season\, settle into a 
 cozy Adirondack chair beneath the dappled shade of umbrellas and enjoy a g
 lass of Franciacorta or a refreshing Spritzer at the Ca'del Bosco Wine Gar
 den. From your seat\, take in the tranquil views of Easton's Bay\, coastal
  beauty without the hassle of the beach or the crowds. Whether you've been
  exploring Newport's iconic Cliff Walk or simply seeking a peaceful escape
 \, the Ca'del Bosco Wine Garden offers the perfect retreat. Relax\, savor 
 exceptional wine\, and let the gentle sea breeze remind you of Newport's t
 imeless charm. Please Note: No reservations are required\, and complimenta
 ry parking is available. Adirondack chairs are offered on a first-come\, f
 irst-served basis with a 90-minute seating limit. A $30 per person food an
 d beverage minimum applies. For additional details\, please refer to our f
 ull list of frequently asked questions here. Open weather permitting and c
 losed for private events on select dates. View the full calendar here.\n\n
 Source: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/ca-del-bosco-wine-garden/10
 9874/
LOCATION:The Chanler at Cliff Walk May 22 - September 7\, 2026 1:00 PM - 8
 :00 PM This season\, settle into a cozy Adirondack chair beneath the dappl
 ed shade of umbrellas and enjoy a glass of Franciacorta or a refreshing Sp
 ritzer at the Ca'del Bosco Wine Garden. From your seat\, take in the tranq
 uil views of Easton's Bay\, coastal beauty without the hassle of the beach
  or the crowds. Whether you've been exploring Newport's iconic Cliff Walk 
